msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「The forest at night is REALLY＿atmospheric. It definitely reeks of＿jumpscares!」"
msgstr "Minori「El bosque de noche SÍ que tiene＿ambiente. ¡Sin duda huele a sustos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Reeks......? Kushieda, I thought you＿didn't have a sense for this stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Huele......? Kushieda, creí que no＿tenías sensibilidad para estas cosas.」"

msgid "Minori「Ehehehe! Maybe I do.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ejejeje! Tal vez sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Dunno. Is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No sé. ¿Será?」"

msgid "Minori「It so is! And if you're particularly quiet,＿you can hear...... \"splash... splash...\" they＿say!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Claro que sí! ¡Y si guardas mucho＿silencio, dicen que se oye......＿\"plash... plash...\"!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Gah......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Gah......!」"

msgid "Minori「Huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I felt something cold on the back of my＿neck just now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Acabo de sentir algo frío en la nuca.」"

msgid "Minori「......Oh? Getting in the mood? That's＿great～ Was it a chill running down＿your spine?」"
msgstr "Minori「......¿Ah? ¿Entrando en ambiente?＿¡Qué genial～! ¿Fue un escalofrío＿por la espalda?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'm pretty sure it was my ne......＿*Gasp*!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, estoy seguro de que＿fue mi cu...... ¡¿Ah?!」"

msgid "Minori「What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The back of my neck is kinda damp......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tengo la nuca un poco húmeda......」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, you! I'm not falling for that one!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ay, vamos! ¡No voy a caer en esa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's true!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Es verdad!」"

msgid "Minori「What? So you're saying......」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué? Entonces quieres decir......」"

msgid "Minori「Eeek!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Ayy!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Minori「...I felt something chilly on the back of＿my neck just now...」"
msgstr "Minori「...Acabo de sentir algo＿helado en la nuca...」"

msgid "Ryuuji「See? Is yours damp now too?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ves? ¿La tuya también está húmeda?」"

msgid "Minori「It is......」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, lo está......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces......」"

msgid "Minori「W-Wait! It's too early to jump to＿conclusions!! We should calmly......」"
msgstr "Minori「¡E-Espera! ¡Es muy pronto para＿sacar conclusiones!! Deberíamos＿actuar con calma......」"

msgid "Minori「EEEEEEEEEK!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡AAAAAAAAAY!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What happened!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué pasó?!」"

msgid "Minori「S-Something touched my neck again!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡A-Algo me tocó el cuello otra vez!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What!? What do we do!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?! ¡¿Qué hacemos?!」"

msgid "Minori「At times like these... times like these...!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡En momentos así... momentos así...!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Whoa! I just felt it! So cold!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Uah! ¡Acabo de sentirlo! ¡Qué frío!」"

msgid "Minori「At last, that which I've longed to＿meet......?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Por fin aquello que tanto＿anhelaba conocer......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Doesn't feel like it's longed for you,＿though.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aunque no parece que te＿haya anhelado a ti.」"

msgid "Minori「Nnnnn～～～!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Mmmmm～～～!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Kushieda?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the? She's frozen stiff, pointing＿over my shoulder? Does that perhaps＿mean......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué pasa? ¿Se quedó tiesa señalando＿sobre mi hombro? ¿Acaso eso significa＿que......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（It's here? Behind me!?!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Está aquí?! ¡¿Detrás de mí?!）」"

msgid "Look"
msgstr "Mirar"

msgid "Don't look"
msgstr "No mirar"

msgid "Ryuuji「Dammit! I've gotta look!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Maldición! ¡Tengo que mirar!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I, I can't! I'm frozen stiff......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡N-No puedo! ¡Estoy paralizado......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ugh, I'm so lame! I'm gonna look!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ugh, qué patético soy! ¡Voy a mirar!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「........................Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「........................¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Nothing's there.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No hay nada.）」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu...... You fell for it.」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju...... Caíste redondito.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Nyeh heh heh heh heh heh! Did you＿think it was the ghost?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ñe je je je je je! ¿Pensaste＿que era el fantasma?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Anyone would think that after＿looking at you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Cualquiera pensaría eso al verte.」"

msgid "Minori「Yep! I figured you would think that, so I＿put on a little act.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sip! Supuse que pensarías eso, así＿que monté un pequeño espectáculo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How could you! I was pretty damn＿scared just now!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Cómo pudiste! ¡Me diste un susto＿terrible ahora mismo!!」"

msgid "Minori「Ehehe! Sorry, sorry. See, when＿someone's enjoying themselves, I can't＿help but join in and get carried away.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ejeje! Perdón, perdón. Es que cuando＿alguien se divierte, no puedo evitar＿unirme y dejarme llevar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When someone's enjoying themselves?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cuando alguien se divierte?」"

msgid "Minori「Yep. See, the mastermind behind the＿\"wet neck\" thing is over in that bush.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip. Mira, la mente maestra＿detrás de lo de la \"nuca mojada\"＿está en ese arbusto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Beg your pardon!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Cómo dices?!」"

msgid "???「Aww man, you figured it out so soon?」"
msgstr "???「Ay, hombre, ¿ya te diste＿cuenta tan pronto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Noto!? I thought you weren't coming＿today!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Noto?! ¡Creí que hoy no ibas a venir!」"

msgid "Noto「Wellll～ You see～ Ami-chan said she＿wanted me to play the role of the＿monster.」"
msgstr "Noto「Bueeeno～ Verás～ Ami-chan dijo que quería＿que hiciera el papel del monstruo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, so that's all it was...... You frickin'＿scared me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, solo era eso...... Qué＿susto me diste, caramba.」"

msgid "Noto「Takasu, you were freaking out～ Man,＿spooking the daylights out of someone＿is surprisingly fun.」"
msgstr "Noto「Takasu, estabas muerto de miedo～ Vaya,＿pegarle un susto tremendo a alguien es＿sorprendentemente divertido.」"

msgid "Noto「But Kushieda, how'd you know it was＿me?」"
msgstr "Noto「Pero Kushieda, ¿cómo supiste que era yo?」"

msgid "Minori「I wasn't sure exactly who it was. But I＿saw a piece of konjac get yanked up＿from behind Takasu-kun on a string.」"
msgstr "Minori「No sabía bien quién era. Pero vi cómo＿alzaban con un hilo un trozo de konjac＿detrás de Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Minori「This kinetic vision I've honed through＿practice isn't just for show!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Esta agudeza visual que pulí con la＿práctica no es solo de adorno!」"

msgid "Noto「Now I get it. Well, I got to scare Takasu,＿so I'm happy.」"
msgstr "Noto「Ahora lo entiendo. Bueno, logré asustar＿a Takasu, así que estoy feliz.」"

msgid "Noto「Well, I'm gonna go spook everyone else.＿See ya later～」"
msgstr "Noto「Bueno, iré a asustar a los＿demás. ¡Nos vemos luego～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So it was Noto......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que era Noto......」"

msgid "Minori「Ghosts aren't so easy to encounter,＿after all～」"
msgstr "Minori「Después de todo, no es tan fácil＿toparse con fantasmas～」"

msgid "Minori「I'll probably............ never encounter one.」"
msgstr "Minori「Probablemente............＿nunca me tope con uno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kushieda......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't say that. There might be＿ghosts out there who want to＿encounter you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No digas eso. Puede que＿haya fantasmas ahí fuera que＿quieran toparse contigo.」"

msgid "Minori「Maybe......」"
msgstr "Minori「Tal vez......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There are. You can't assume you＿\"never will\" just because you \"haven't＿yet.\" In the same way......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Los hay. No puedes asumir que \"nunca＿lo harás\" solo porque \"aún no\".＿Del mismo modo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I don't want you to think about it like＿that.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No quiero que pienses así sobre esto.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It'd be MOTTAINAI to give up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Rendirse: ¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Minori「I see. You're right. MOTTAINAI for＿sure. Ehehe!」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya veo. Tienes razón. ¡QUÉ＿DESPERDICIO! ¡Ejeje!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（You can't see it, but ghosts - and love＿for you - both exist. So don't say such＿sad things, Kushieda.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No puedes verlo, pero los fantasmas -y＿el amor por ti- existen. Así que no＿digas cosas tan tristes, Kushieda.）」"

msgid "Minori「I feel like we've had this same...... Oh!」"
msgstr "Minori「Siento que ya tuvimos esta＿misma...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Minori「I-It's nothing.」"
msgstr "Minori「N-No es nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hm?」"

msgid "Minori「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué ocurre?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... Someone's standing by that＿tree over there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... Hay alguien de pie＿junto a ese árbol de allá.」"

msgid "Minori「Huh? Maybe it's Amin?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? ¿Tal vez es Amin?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's too tall to be Kawashima.＿Compared to the tree itself, it's＿approximately 3 meters tall...... Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es demasiado alto para ser Kawashima.＿Comparado con el árbol, mide unos 3＿metros de altura...... ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Hey, is that......」"
msgstr "Minori「Oye, ¿eso es......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Y-Yeah...... It seems a bit strange......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「S-Sí...... Se ve un poco extraño......」"

msgid "Minori「\"A bit\"......!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿\"Un poco\"......?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「WHOA!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡UAH!!」"

msgid "Minori「T-Takasu-kun! L-Look!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡T-Takasu-kun! ¡¡M-Mira!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Something's pouring from its＿mouth!? It's bright red...... blood......!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿L-Le brota algo de la boca?! ¡¿Es rojo＿brillante...... sangre......?!」"

msgid "Minori「T-T-That's......」"
msgstr "Minori「E-E-Eso es......」"

msgid "We should get out of here"
msgstr "Deberíamos salir de aquí"

msgid "I've seen this before......"
msgstr "Ya he visto esto antes......"

msgid "Do we have a light source?"
msgstr "¿Tenemos alguna fuente de luz?"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda, for now, we should......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda, por ahora deberíamos......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「AAAAAAAAAAHHH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AAAAAAAAAAHHH!」"

msgid "Minori「GAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡GAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Kushieda?!」"

msgid "Minori「NOOO～～～～～～!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡NOOO～～～～～～!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wait for me, Kushieda!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡E-Espérame, Kushieda!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I've seen this before......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya he visto esto antes......」"

msgid "Minori「Huh......?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In a movie......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En una película......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「AAAAAAAAAAHHH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AAAAAAAAAAHHH!」"

msgid "Minori「GAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡GAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Kushieda?!」"

msgid "Minori「NOOO～～～～～～!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡NOOO～～～～～～!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wait for me, Kushieda!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡E-Espérame, Kushieda!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Do we have a light source of some＿kind?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tenemos algún tipo de fuente de luz?」"

msgid "Minori「W-What good is a light source!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿D-De qué sirve una fuente de luz?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Well, because...... Oh, I brought that＿firework......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bueno, porque...... Ah, traje＿aquel fuego artificial......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「AAAAAAAAAAHHH!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AAAAAAAAAAHHH!」"

msgid "Minori「GAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡GAAAAAAAAAHHHH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Kushieda?!」"

msgid "Minori「NOOO～～～～～～!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡NOOO～～～～～～!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wait for me, Kushieda!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡E-Espérame, Kushieda!!」"

msgid "Minori「*Pant* *Pant* *Pant*......」"
msgstr "Minori「*Jadeo* *Jadeo* *Jadeo*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda...... You scared me half to＿death, taking off like that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda...... Casi me matas del susto＿saliendo corriendo así......」"

msgid "Minori「I, I took off because you started＿screaming, bud!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Y-Yo salí corriendo porque tú＿empezaste a gritar, amigo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「B-But weren't you enjoying seeing me＿scared?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿P-Pero no estabas disfrutando＿verme asustado?」"

msgid "Minori「Yeah, but...... I was, but......!」"
msgstr "Minori「Sí, pero...... lo estaba, ¡pero......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「WHOOOA!? W-What is it now!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿UAAAH?! ¡¿Q-Qué pasa ahora?!」"

msgid "Minori「AAAAAAAAAAAGH!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡AAAAAAAAAAAGH!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda! HEY! Where are you going!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kushieda! ¡OYE! ¡¿A dónde vas?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Where the hell are you trying to go in＿the dark!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿A dónde demonios intentas＿ir en la oscuridad?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Pant* *Pant* *Pant*... Kushieda...＿where did you go?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Jadeo* *Jadeo* *Jadeo*... Kushieda...＿¿a dónde fuiste?」"

msgid "???「Huh? Taka-chan?」"
msgstr "???「¿Eh? ¿Taka-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Haruta「It IS you, Taka-chan! Whew～ What a＿relief～ Are you all alone too?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡SÍ eres tú, Taka-chan! Uf～ Qué alivio～＿¿Tú también estás solo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. What happened to your partner?＿You were with Taiga, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. ¿Qué pasó con tu pareja?＿Ibas con Taiga, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Haruta「Well, ya see, we got separated.」"
msgstr "Haruta「Bueno, verás, nos separamos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga and Kushieda met up?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Taiga y Kushieda se encontraron?」"

msgid "Haruta「Yup. That's what she told me.」"
msgstr "Haruta「Sip. Eso fue lo que me dijo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see...... I was looking for Kushieda, but＿if she's with Taiga, then she's okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo...... Estaba buscando＿a Kushieda, pero si está con＿Taiga, entonces está bien.」"

msgid "Haruta「For now, like, wanna keep going? For＿some reason, we still haven't reached＿the observatory, dude.」"
msgstr "Haruta「Por ahora, ¿seguimos adelante? Por＿alguna razón, todavía no llegamos＿al observatorio, amigo.」"

msgid "Haruta「Why's that?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Y eso por qué?」"

msgid "Haruta「Really? Hmmm～ Maybe it's because＿we took a shortcut off the main path.」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿En serio? Mmmm～ Tal vez sea＿porque tomamos un atajo fuera＿del camino principal.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How could you do something so＿dangerous at night in the dark?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo pudiste hacer algo tan peligroso＿de noche y a oscuras?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There's no way Taiga would say you're＿\"So cool～①\".」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni en sueños Taiga te diría＿\"¡Qué genial～①!\".」"

msgid "Haruta「Ohhh, I guess not.」"
msgstr "Haruta「Ohhh, supongo que no.」"

msgid "Haruta「Guess we don't have a choice at this＿point～ How about the two of us dudes＿hit up the observatory?」"
msgstr "Haruta「Supongo que a estas alturas no＿hay opción～ ¿Qué tal si los dos＿vamos al observatorio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I've already been there. If you wanna＿go, go by yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo ya estuve ahí. Si quieres＿ir, ve tú solo.」"

msgid "Haruta「Whaaat～? That's so cold, bro! In that＿case I'm goin' back with you.」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Quéee～? ¡Qué frío eres, amigo!＿En ese caso vuelvo contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah? Then let's head for the＿rendezvous point.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sí? Entonces vamos al＿punto de encuentro.」"

msgid "Haruta「Okie-dokie!」"
msgstr "Haruta「¡Hecho!」"

msgid "Minori「*Pant* *Pant* *Pant*......」"
msgstr "Minori「*Jadeo* *Jadeo* *Jadeo*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda...... You scared me half to＿death, taking off like that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda...... Casi me matas del susto＿saliendo corriendo así......」"

msgid "Minori「I, I took off because you started＿screaming, bud!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Y-Yo salí corriendo porque tú＿empezaste a gritar, amigo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I couldn't help it! I-It caught me off＿guard!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No pude evitarlo! ¡M-Me＿tomó por sorpresa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Gasp*...... Was that an actual ghost?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... ¿Eso era un fantasma de verdad?」"

msgid "Minori「......」"
msgstr "Minori「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I saw something exactly like it in＿\"Official Record: Japan's Archipelago＿of Horror.\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vi algo exactamente igual en \"Registro＿Oficial: El archipiélago del terror＿de Japón\".」"

msgid "Minori「............No, that wasn't a ghost.」"
msgstr "Minori「............No, eso no era un fantasma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But it was clearly suspicious.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero era claramente sospechoso.」"

msgid "Minori「It just doesn't feel right.」"
msgstr "Minori「Simplemente no me cuadra.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Doesn't feel right\"? But you haven't＿even seen a real one. How would you＿know if it \"felt right\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"No te cuadra\"? Pero ni siquiera＿has visto uno real. ¿Cómo sabrías＿si \"cuadra\"?」"

msgid "Minori「............But it was just...... like...... I can't＿put it into words, but it was weird.」"
msgstr "Minori「............Pero es que......＿como que...... No sabría explicarlo,＿pero era raro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'd say a ghost is pretty weird, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo diría que un fantasma＿es bastante raro, sí.」"

msgid "Minori「That's not what I meant. It's like...... It＿didn't feel supernatural, I guess......」"
msgstr "Minori「No me refiero a eso. Es como＿que...... No se sentía sobrenatural,＿supongo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But it's not every day something like＿that gushes blood. That's why it's gotta＿be a ghost!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero no todos los días algo así＿escupe sangre. ¡Por eso tiene＿que ser un fantasma!」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm......」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Shall we go back and have a second＿look at it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Volvemos a echarle＿un segundo vistazo?」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm......」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......That's strange. Wasn't Kushieda＿interested in ghosts?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Qué extraño. ¿A Kushieda no＿le interesaban los fantasmas?）」"

msgid "Minori「......Let's keep going. If we're late＿getting back, Taiga and the others will＿start to worry.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Sigamos adelante. Si tardamos＿en volver, Taiga y los demás empezarán＿a preocuparse.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're right. Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes razón. Está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「*Pant* *Pant* *Pant*......」"
msgstr "Minori「*Jadeo* *Jadeo* *Jadeo*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda...... You scared me half to＿death, taking off like that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「K-Kushieda...... Casi me matas del susto＿saliendo corriendo así......」"

msgid "Minori「I, I took off because you started＿screaming, bud!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Y-Yo salí corriendo porque tú＿empezaste a gritar, amigo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I couldn't help it! I-It caught me off＿guard!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No pude evitarlo! ¡M-Me＿tomó por sorpresa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Minori「..................」"
msgstr "Minori「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Did you see that ghost just now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Viste ese fantasma hace un rato?」"

msgid "Minori「..................」"
msgstr "Minori「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That HAD to be a ghost......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso TENÍA que ser un fantasma......」"

msgid "Minori「......I...... didn't see it.」"
msgstr "Minori「......Yo...... no lo vi.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Minori「There's no way...... that ghosts exist.」"
msgstr "Minori「Es imposible...... que existan＿los fantasmas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But you were scared too, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero tú también te asustaste, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Minori「Was I......? It was dark, after all. Maybe＿you were seeing things.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Yo......? Estaba oscuro, después＿de todo. Tal vez viste cosas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I should have lit the firework to check.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Debí haber encendido el fuego＿artificial para comprobarlo.」"

msgid "Minori「Haha! You brought a firework? That's＿funny......」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Jaja! ¿Trajiste un fuego artificial?＿Qué gracioso......」"

msgid "Minori「Tests of courage really are meant for＿the summer! Ending 'em with a shower＿of fireworks is just the best!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Las pruebas de valor son para el＿verano! ¡Terminarlas con una lluvia＿de fuegos artificiales es lo mejor!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Kushieda? What's the matter with＿you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Kushieda? ¿Qué te pasa?」"

msgid "Minori「Nothing at all. C'mon, let's keep going!」"
msgstr "Minori「Nada en absoluto. ¡Vamos, sigamos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「Places like these really are creepy at＿night.」"
msgstr "Minori「Lugares así sí que dan miedo de noche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Minori「I wonder why the people who claim to＿have seen the ghost even came to＿such a desolate place at all.」"
msgstr "Minori「Me pregunto por qué quienes dicen haber＿visto al fantasma siquiera vinieron＿a un lugar tan desolado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Good question......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Buena pregunta......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Why is Kushieda pretending like＿there wasn't a ghost? I'm certain she＿saw it too......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Por qué Kushieda finge que no＿había ningún fantasma? Estoy seguro de＿que ella también lo vio......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Unable to see it, she must be＿distancing herself from it--）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Al no poder verlo, debe estar＿tomando distancia de ello--）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah..................」"

msgid "\"Actually, I've decided I don't need to＿see UFOs and ghosts after all.\""
msgstr "\"La verdad, decidí que ya no necesito＿ver ovnis ni fantasmas.\""

msgid "Ryuuji「......O......h......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......A......h......」"

msgid "Minori「Takasu-kun, are you okay!? Are you＿dizzy!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Takasu-kun! ¿Estás bien?＿¡¿Estás mareado?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Er......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, seems I got a little lightheaded＿there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, parece que me mareé un poco.」"

msgid "Minori「Huh? Really!? Wanna sit down and＿take a break? You should rest!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? ¡¿En serio?! ¿Quieres＿sentarte a tomar un respiro?＿¡¡Deberías descansar!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm...... fine now. Please don't worry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya...... estoy bien. No te preocupes.」"

msgid "Minori「Really? But you should rest as soon as＿you can. Let's hurry back!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿En serio? Pero descansa en cuanto＿puedas. ¡Apresurémonos a volver!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I remember now, Taiga......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ya lo recuerdo, Taiga......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......I was rejected by Kushieda.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Kushieda me rechazó.）」"

msgid "Kitamura「One, two, three...... Good, everyone's＿here! Glad to see everyone made their＿way back through the darkness!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Uno, dos, tres...... ¡Bien, están todos!＿¡Me alegra que todos lograran volver＿en medio de la oscuridad!」"

msgid "Taiga「We have an extra though......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aunque nos sobra uno......」"

msgid "Noto「Owww...... Tiger, it still hurts where you＿punched me.」"
msgstr "Noto「Ayyy...... Tigre, todavía me＿duele donde me golpeaste.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph! Be grateful that's all I did.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Jum! Agradece que solo hice eso.」"

msgid "Haruta「She's right～ Notocchi's lucky that's all＿she did～ Meanwhile, I'll be damaged＿goods for the rest of my life......」"
msgstr "Haruta「Tiene razón～ Notocchi tuvo suerte de que＿solo fuera eso～ En cambio, yo seré＿mercancía dañada de por vida......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That sounds... interesting...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso suena... interesante...」"

msgid "Taiga「H-H-HEY! You stupid rotten hippie!＿Don't make it sound all WEIRD!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡O-O-OYE! ¡Hippie estúpido y podrido!＿¡No hagas que suene RARO!」"

msgid "Ami「Wow, wouldn't have pegged Tiger as＿the deflowering type～ Isn't it kinda＿cruel to take someone's first time?」"
msgstr "Ami「Vaya, no habría metido a Tigre en el＿grupo de las desfloradoras～ ¿No es＿cruel quitar la primera vez?」"

msgid "Taiga「I don't want you pegging me at all!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No quiero que me metas en nada!」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat? And what kind of \"pegging\"＿are YOU thinking about?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee? ¿Y en qué clase de \"metida\"＿estás pensando TÚ?」"

msgid "Taiga「Y-You DIRTY CHIHUAHUA!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡C-CHIHUAHUA SUCIA!!」"

msgid "Minori「Now now, calm down. We all got＿through a test of courage safely! We＿should be celebrating!」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya, ya, cálmense. ¡Todos superamos＿la prueba de valor a salvo! ¡Deberíamos＿celebrarlo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kitamura!」"

msgid "Kitamura「What is it?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did you see anything weird during the＿test?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Viste algo raro durante la prueba?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Something weird? Like what?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Algo raro? ¿Como qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Like a ghost.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Como un fantasma.」"

msgid "Kitamura「A ghost!? ......No, I didn't see anything＿like that. All I saw was Noto's antics.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¿Un fantasma?! ......No, no＿vi nada por el estilo. Solo vi＿las payasadas de Noto.」"

msgid "Noto「What? What did I do?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿Qué? ¿Qué hice yo?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Noto, did you encounter any real＿ghosts while you were doing your＿ghost act?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Noto, ¿te topaste con algún＿fantasma real mientras hacías＿tu acto de fantasma?」"

msgid "Noto「What!? Ghosts? Yeah right!」"
msgstr "Noto「¡¿Qué?! ¿Fantasmas? ¡Sí, claro!」"

msgid "Haruta「Aww, me neither～ I wanted to meet＿that hottie, dude!」"
msgstr "Haruta「Ayy, yo tampoco～ ¡Quería conocer＿a esa preciosura, amigo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So no one else encountered it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que nadie más se lo topó......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Was there something you wanted to＿tell us?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Había algo que nos quisieras contar?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, not really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, en realidad no.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Really? Alright then, let's end it here.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Seguro? Bueno, entonces＿terminemos por hoy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............Está bien.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright, we're done here! It's pretty＿late, so be careful on your way home,＿please!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Listo, terminamos! Ya es bastante＿tarde, así que tengan cuidado al＿volver a casa, ¡por favor!」"

msgid "Noto「Awww. I wonder if I can take a bath＿tonight...... I should put some ice on this＿bruise.」"
msgstr "Noto「Ayyy. Me pregunto si podré bañarme＿esta noche...... Debería ponerme＿hielo en este moretón.」"

msgid "Haruta「So like, why'd we do this in the winter?＿Seriously, why?」"
msgstr "Haruta「O sea, ¿por qué hicimos esto en＿invierno? En serio, ¿por qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Brrr～ Feels even colder standing still.＿Let's hurry home so I can get a hot＿drink.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Brrr～ Se siente más frío sin movernos.＿Volvamos rápido a casa para tomar＿algo caliente.」"

msgid "Minori「What's the matter, Taiga? If you're so＿cold, then I'mma just hug you!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué pasa, Taiga? ¡Si tienes tanto＿frío, entonces te voy a abrazar!」"

msgid "Ami「See ya, Takasu-kun. Bye-bye.」"
msgstr "Ami「Nos vemos, Takasu-kun. Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「See you at school.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nos vemos en la escuela.」"

msgid "Ami「..................Okay.」"
msgstr "Ami「..................Está bien.」"

msgid "Minori「I mean, isn't this exactly like those＿quiet, forested, mountain spirit＿haunted spots they write about in」"
msgstr "Minori「O sea, ¿no es exactamente igual a esos＿lugares boscosos y tranquilos con＿espíritus de la montaña de los que」"

msgid "Minori「magazines?」"
msgstr "Minori「hablan las revistas?」"

msgid "Noto「I was like \"no way, it's cold as balls\"～＿but then she said I'm the best at head＿games like this, so I just couldn't turn」"
msgstr "Noto「Dije: \"ni hablar, hace un frío＿horrible\"～ Pero dijo que soy el mejor＿para estos juegos mentales y no pude」"

msgid "Noto「her down, see?」"
msgstr "Noto「rechazarla, ¿ves?」"

msgid "Haruta「So I called her cell phone, and＿apparently she'd met up with＿Kushieda, so she told me to go it」"
msgstr "Haruta「Así que la llamé al celular y parece＿que se había encontrado con Kushieda,＿así que me dijo que siguiera」"

msgid "Haruta「alone～」"
msgstr "Haruta「solo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You haven't......? Come to think of it,＿you and Taiga were the first team to＿leave. So isn't it kinda weird that」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Aún no......? Ahora que lo pienso, tú＿y Taiga fueron los primeros en salir.＿¿No es un poco raro que」"

msgid "Ryuuji「you've only gotten this far?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「solo hayan llegado hasta aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It just is. If you guys were walking at a＿casual pace, by now one would think＿you should have arrived at the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que sí. Si caminaban a paso＿tranquilo, a estas alturas cualquiera＿pensaría que ya habrían llegado al」"

msgid "Ryuuji「observatory and already be on the＿path back.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「observatorio y ya irían＿de camino de vuelta.」"

msgid "Haruta「Whaaat? Don't all guys get curious?＿And wanna go on adventures? And＿wanna do something reckless so the」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Quéee? ¿No les da curiosidad a todos＿los chicos? ¿Y no quieren aventuras? ¿Y＿hacer algo temerario para que la」"

msgid "Haruta「girl goes \"So cool～①\"?」"
msgstr "Haruta「chica diga \"¡Qué genial～①!\"?」"
